**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.wrangler
**/.dev.vars*
**/.env*
# The local dev stack's CA key and browser profile (X-06) never go into an image.
.dev
.git
apps/dashboard/src/paraglide
**/routeTree.gen.ts
**/worker-configuration.d.ts
# The e2e stack builds this image; its sources and results would only invalidate the install layer on every edit.
# Its manifest stays, since `bun install --frozen-lockfile` needs every workspace.
e2e/*
!e2e/package.json
